  and the Anycubic ZIP (.pwsz, .pm7, .pm7m, .pm4u, .pp1, .pp1m) and binary
  (.pwmx, .pwma, .pm3, .pws and the rest) printer-file writers, ported to
  Rust from UVtools v7.1.1. See libs/sla-formats-uvtools/NOTICE.
  https://github.com/sn4k3/UVtools
